{"parse": {"title": "Sack (Disambiguation)", "pageid": 13223, "revid": 305553, "redirects": [{"from": "Sack", "to": "Sack (Disambiguation)"}], "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Sack</b> may refer to:\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Enemies\">Enemies</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Boil#Sack\" title=\"Boil\">Sack</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Monsters\" title=\"Monsters\">monster</a> that spawns spiders.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Boil#Walking_Variants\" title=\"Boil\">Walking Sack</a>, a mobile version of the Sack.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fatty#Fat_Sack\" title=\"Fatty\">Fat Sack</a>, a variant of the <a href=\"/wiki/Fatty\" title=\"Fatty\">Fatty</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fatty#Half_Sack\" title=\"Fatty\">Half Sack</a>, a variant of the <a href=\"/wiki/Fatty\" title=\"Fatty\">Fatty</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Items\">Items</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-14\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth\"><img alt=\"(except in Rebirth)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/95/Dlc_a_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220122155526\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;Bursting+Sack&#124;14\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bursting_Sack\" title=\"Bursting Sack\"><img alt=\"Collectible Bursting Sack icon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/8/82/Collectible_Bursting_Sack_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821145926\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Bursting Sack icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Bursting_Sack_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bursting_Sack\" title=\"Bursting Sack\">Bursting Sack</a></span>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Item#Passive_Collectibles\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item\">passive item</a> that makes most spiders passive.</li>\n<li><span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;Juicy+Sack&#124;15\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Juicy_Sack\" title=\"Juicy Sack\"><img alt=\"Collectible Juicy Sack icon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/c/c8/Collectible_Juicy_Sack_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821042055\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Juicy Sack icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Juicy_Sack_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Juicy_Sack\" title=\"Juicy Sack\">Juicy Sack</a></span>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Item#Passive_Collectibles\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item\">passive item</a> that spawns friendly Blue Spiders and leaves a trail of slowing white creep.</li>\n<li><span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;Mystery+Sack&#124;15\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystery_Sack\" title=\"Mystery Sack\"><img alt=\"Collectible Mystery Sack icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Mystery Sack icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Mystery_Sack_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/c/ce/Collectible_Mystery_Sack_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821083717\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mystery_Sack\" title=\"Mystery Sack\">Mystery Sack</a></span>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Item#Passive_Collectibles\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item\">passive item</a> that spawns random pickups.</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-14\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth\"><img alt=\"(except in Rebirth)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/95/Dlc_a_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220122155526\" /></span></span> <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;Sack+Head&#124;14\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sack_Head\" title=\"Sack Head\"><img alt=\"Collectible Sack Head icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Sack Head icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Sack_Head_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/7a/Collectible_Sack_Head_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821134849\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sack_Head\" title=\"Sack Head\">Sack Head</a></span>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Item#Passive_Collectibles\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item\">passive item</a> that turns pickups into Sack pickups.</li>\n<li><span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;Sack+of+Pennies&#124;15\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sack_of_Pennies\" title=\"Sack of Pennies\"><img alt=\"Collectible Sack of Pennies icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Sack of Pennies icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Sack_of_Pennies_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f3/Collectible_Sack_of_Pennies_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821083817\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sack_of_Pennies\" title=\"Sack of Pennies\">Sack of Pennies</a></span>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Item#Passive_Collectibles\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item\">passive item</a> that spawns pennies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-12\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth †\"><img alt=\"(in Afterbirth † and Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a† indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a%E2%80%A0_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/4c/Dlc_a%E2%80%A0_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220204205709\" /></span></span> <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;Sack+of+Sacks&#124;12\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sack_of_Sacks\" title=\"Sack of Sacks\"><img alt=\"Collectible Sack of Sacks icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Sack of Sacks icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Sack_of_Sacks_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1e/Collectible_Sack_of_Sacks_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210822021220\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sack_of_Sacks\" title=\"Sack of Sacks\">Sack of Sacks</a></span>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Item#Passive_Collectibles\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item\">passive item</a> that spawns sacks.</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"t/tooltip&#124;Lucky+Sack&#124;8\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lucky_Sack\" title=\"Lucky Sack\"><img alt=\"Lucky Sack\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trinket Lucky Sack icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Trinket_Lucky_Sack_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/d/dc/Trinket_Lucky_Sack_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825164419\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Lucky_Sack\" title=\"Lucky Sack\">Lucky Sack</a></span>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Trinket\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trinket\">Trinket</a> that spawns a sack at the start of every floor.</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;Keeper%27s+Sack&#124;8\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Keeper%27s_Sack\" title=\"Keeper&#39;s Sack\"><img alt=\"Collectible Keeper&#39;s Sack icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Keeper&#39;s Sack icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Keeper%27s_Sack_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/41/Collectible_Keeper%27s_Sack_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20211111110832\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Keeper%27s_Sack\" title=\"Keeper&#39;s Sack\">Keeper's Sack</a></span>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Item#Passive_Collectibles\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item\">passive item</a> that gives you stat bonuses for purchasing items at shops.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pickups\">Pickups</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-14\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth\"><img alt=\"(except in Rebirth)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/95/Dlc_a_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220122155526\" /></span></span>  <a href=\"/wiki/Sacks_(Pickup)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sacks (Pickup)\">Sacks</a>, a type of <a href=\"/wiki/Pickups\" title=\"Pickups\">pic